          "value": "<p>The troop can hurl weighted nets in place of its usual Salvo attack. The nets deal no damage; instead, each creature that fails its save is slowed 1 (slowed 2 on a critical failure) as it is entangled. A creature slowed this way can spend an action to attempt an Escape against the troop's Battle DC to end the effect. The troop cannot hurl nets beyond the range of its Salvo attack.</p>"
